	(text " on enable, write VREF_L (0x00)=0x05, \nVREF_H (0x01)=0xEF, GO (0x02)=0x01 → 16.8V; \nIOUT_LIM (0x03)=0x32 → 2.5A; \nCTL1 (0x04)=0xB0 → forced-PWM/500kHz/latch-off."
